/*
 * lib/cpu/amd-epyc/SLAMDEPYC9475F.sleela
 * SLeeLa Standard Library Definition.
 * Definition: AMD EPYC 9475F (Zen 5 "Turin", 9005 F-series high-frequency).
 *   48 cores / 96 threads, 3.65 GHz base / 4.8 GHz max boost, 256 MB L3,
 *   12-channel DDR5, SP5, ~400 W. A thin SKU subclass of SLAMDEPYCCPU
